text:
@spock949Ok ok. I’ll admit that I don’t follow VTI as I don’t like total market ETFs. I wrongly assumed that it was another SPY type ETF. I honestly didn’t even read the ticker. I just assumed you were someone thinking that swapping tickers magically avoided wash sale rules. 

I was wrong. My apologies. 

Also, I’m shocked at how well a total market etf has kept up with VOO over YTD, 1yr and 5yr. Maybe I’m wrong about total market ETFs too…
